          </button>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-tertiary); margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 0;">
          Full per-client JSON/TOML in the <a href={withBase("usage.html#mcp-server")} style="color: var(--text-tertiary);">MCP Server docs →</a>
        </p>
